  "label": "Disparaging Analogy: 'Goats can't talk'",
  "description": "The phrase 'goats can't talk' is a degrading metaphor used to imply that Muslim men are incapable of speaking out or reporting crimes, suggesting they are mute or complicit. This is a form of animalization that reduces human beings to animals, which is a common tactic in hate speech and dehumanization.",
